      "authorType": "TOPIC",
      "competitionRanking": 748,
      "content": "<p>I think first ranked below \"Alice's Wonderland\" with 0.82, and then I ranked above them with 0.82.</p>\n<p>If there are 250 examples in the public leaderboard, the scores would look like this</p>\n<ul>\n<li>205 / 250 -&gt; 0.820 -&gt; 0.82</li>\n<li>206 / 250 -&gt; 0.824 -&gt; 0.82</li>\n<li>207 / 250 -&gt; 0.828 -&gt; 0.82</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The training set is 9500, it felt like 10000 were generated and 250 goes to the public leaderboard and 250 goes to the private leaderboard.</p>",
      "feedbackTrackingData": {},
